1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,480
Is this a snake

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,780
or a TREE?

3
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:04,537
You've got two seconds.

4
00:00:04,537 --> 00:00:05,640
A tree.

5
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,212
Forty metres tall...

6
00:00:07,212 --> 00:00:08,633
wearing snakeskin.

7
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:09,671
Every diamond

8
00:00:09,671 --> 00:00:11,567
is where a leaf fell off.

9
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:13,570
Three hundred million years ago,

10
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:15,733
whole swamps of them fell over...

11
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:16,870
got buried...

12
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:19,067
and squashed into COAL.

13
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:20,980
Steam trains burned them...

14
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,400
by the TON.

15
00:00:22,443 --> 00:00:23,704
And miners still find

16
00:00:23,704 --> 00:00:25,611
their stumps in the ceiling...

17
00:00:25,611 --> 00:00:26,818
and sometimes,

18
00:00:26,818 --> 00:00:28,167
they FALL.

19
00:00:28,207 --> 00:00:29,977
Snake, tree,

20
00:00:29,977 --> 00:00:30,827
coal...

21
00:00:30,827 --> 00:00:32,120
ceiling hazard.

22
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,550
What a career.

